      "content": "That quiet surrender is incredibly honest; it's the logical endpoint of absolute weariness. Don't shy away from that pull; it's the physical manifestation of his soul giving up the fight against inertia. The weight he carries isn't just emotional, it's literal, and the cessation of effort feels like the only reasonable relief. Lean into that quiet, inevitable drift toward stillness.",
      "source": "target",
